# ============================================
# SOTTO MOBILE — ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ============================================
#
# Copy values from the repo root .env.local or run:
#
#   npm run mobile:env
#
# The command writes apps/mobile/.env from .env.local. It derives
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL from NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL when the API URL is absent.
#
# This runs automatically before:
#   npm run mobile:ios
#   npm run mobile:android
#
# Required:
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3000/api/v1
# ============================================
